  "description": "A form of discrimination and social disadvantage experienced by people with disabilities, including autistic individuals. The meme's dismissive tone and implication that autism is 'just another month' can be seen as a form of ableism, as it devalues the lived experiences and advocacy efforts of autistic people.",
